  ContextEn: The crossing has been cleared, but the zombies are advancing.
  ContextTr: "Ge\xE7i\u015F temizlendi, ancak zombiler geliyor."
  ObjectiveRu: "\u0423\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435
