  ObjectiveEn: Hold the ferry until the evacuation ships arrive (9 waves).
  ObjectiveTr: "Tahliye gemileri gelene kadar ge\xE7i\u015Fi tutun (9 dalga)."
  LocationRu: "\u0420\u0435\u0447\u043D\u0430\u044F \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0430."
